From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 12:31:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mac80211: fix station lookup for management frames on
 4-address VLANs

A 4-address station is moved to its own AP_VLAN interface, but management
frames for it are still transmitted on the AP interface. In that case the
per-interface lookup fails, so use the BSS wide lookup for management
frames as well.

Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
---

--- a/net/mac80211/tx.c
+++ b/net/mac80211/tx.c
@@ -1238,7 +1238,8 @@ ieee80211_tx_prepare(struct ieee80211_su
 			tx->sta = rcu_dereference(sdata->u.vlan.sta);
 			if (!tx->sta && sdata->wdev.use_4addr)
 				return TX_DROP;
-		} else if (tx->sdata->control_port_protocol == tx->skb->protocol) {
+		} else if (tx->sdata->control_port_protocol == tx->skb->protocol ||
+			   ieee80211_is_mgmt(hdr->frame_control)) {
 			tx->sta = sta_info_get_bss(sdata, hdr->addr1);
 		}
 		if (!tx->sta && !is_multicast_ether_addr(hdr->addr1)) {
